    - target: {fileID: 1616189112948871216, guid: 099a92b75e5214f4e9035d67bfb11b51,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'In this guide you will find a variety of recipes and my personal insights
        to the art of cooking, as such not everything will be available from the
        get go. You will need to explore, research and try to accomplish everything
        on your own if you cant find any advice on it.


        -Journal Entry

        -The
        Ship

        -Workstations

        -Resource Collection

        -Clients

        -Star
        Critics

        -Piece of advice

        -Recipes'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
