    - target: {fileID: 1616189112948871216, guid: 099a92b75e5214f4e9035d67bfb11b51,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: I assumme you found my old ship from my young days, this is nothing
        too luxurious but it will get the job done, try to no crash it in some desolate
        planet and try to keep it clean, even if i can't use it anymore, it doesn't
        mean that i won't worry about it, the navigation console should be funcional
        and as long as the workstations work too, i trust that you can make the best
        of them.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
