    - target: {fileID: 6986584900248840896, guid: 099a92b75e5214f4e9035d67bfb11b51,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'To whoevert find this book, in my last years i''ve come to accept that
        i can''t complete my last wish so i will scatter all my recipes for you to
        find.


        Impress the Star Critics and earn their Gold Novas, those
        will mark your journey through space, get all of them and fulfill my last
        wish. To see the secret treasure hidden behind those medals.


        Take
        my hat and get to work, chase those Novas and uncover what i couldn''t, finish
        my work no matter what it takes, i''ll leave it all to you.


        Best
        of luck - Gravy Jones'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
